# CrossHook local secrets: 1Password references only, never values.
#
# Each entry is NAME=op://<vault>/<item>/<field>. scripts/with-secrets.sh runs a
# command under `op run --env-file=.env.op` when this file has any entry, and
# runs it directly when it has none. scripts/check-secrets-policy.sh rejects any
# line here that is not a comment, a blank line, or an op:// reference.
#
# CrossHook needs no secrets to build, test or run today, so there are no
# entries. Add one per variable when a local workflow needs a secret, e.g.:
#
#   EXAMPLE_API_TOKEN=op://<vault>/<item>/EXAMPLE_API_TOKEN
